by GromNaN at 2026-09-23T16:33:25Z

You can't modify the key material for a given keyId (file name); otherwise every data everything that has been encrypted with this keyId will fail to be decrypted. That's a design contract of the KMS. The only permitted operations are: adding a new key with a new keyId, or remove a key (and loose all the encrypted data).
